  "releaseNotes": "Update box3d to https://github.com/erincatto/box3d/commit/c37cfe4\n## SIMD hull collision (#93)\nSIMD based hull collision inspired by example code from @cairnc in #54\n<img width=\"1676\" height=\"1332\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/58b137bd-bf7b-4c99-863c-64341b973a3d\"\n/>\n- Fixed #78\n- Fixed #85 and fixed CI to error on UB.\n- Updated benchmarks\n- Added AMD scalar benchmarks\n- Added Neon benchmarks\n- More determinism unit tests\n- Sample leak detection\n- Added b3Body_AllowFastRotation\n- Added b3Body_IsFastRotationAllowed\n- Bumped b3HullData version\n- Bumped b3CompoundData version",
